---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";

const lang = 'en';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy | My Paws Bosnia" description="How My Paws Bosnia handles your personal data when you submit an adoption application." lang={lang}>
  <section class="bg-light-bg py-12 md:py-16">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-slate-dark">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-body">Last updated: October 2026</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12">
    <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-10 shadow-sm border border-gray-100 space-y-8">

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-dark mb-3">Who we are</h2>
        <p class="text-body leading-relaxed">My Paws Bosnia is a dog rescue charity based in Brcko, Bosnia and Herzegovina. We rescue stray and abandoned dogs and find them loving homes across Europe. If you have any questions about this policy, you can reach us at <a href="mailto:donate2mypaws@gmail.com" class="text-teal hover:underline">donate2mypaws@gmail.com</a>.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-dark mb-3">What data we collect</h2>
        <p class="text-body leading-relaxed">When you fill out our adoption application form, we collect the following information:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mt-2 text-body space-y-1">
          <li>Your name, email address, and phone number</li>
          <li>Your country and city</li>
          <li>Your home type, household composition, and whether you own or rent</li>
          <li>Your pet ownership history and daily routine</li>
          <li>Any free-text answers you provide (questions, messages, etc.)</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-dark mb-3">Why we collect it</h2>
        <p class="text-body leading-relaxed">We use this information to process your adoption application, arrange home checks, and coordinate transport of your dog to your home.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-dark mb-3">Legal basis</h2>
        <p class="text-body leading-relaxed">We process your data based on your consent. You give this consent by checking the privacy consent box before submitting the adoption application form.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-dark mb-3">How your data is processed</h2>
        <p class="text-body leading-relaxed">When you submit the adoption form, your application is sent to us via <a href="https://web3forms.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-teal hover:underline">Web3Forms</a>. We also send you a confirmation email via <a href="https://resend.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-teal hover:underline">Resend</a>. Your data is not stored in any database beyond these services.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-dark mb-3">Who has access to your data</h2>
        <p class="text-body leading-relaxed">Only the My Paws Bosnia team (Vesna and her family) has access to your application data.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-dark mb-3">Data sharing</h2>
        <p class="text-body leading-relaxed">We do not sell, rent, or share your personal data with third parties. We may share your contact details with our licensed transport provider to arrange delivery of your dog.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-dark mb-3">Data retention</h2>
        <p class="text-body leading-relaxed">We keep your application data for as long as needed to process the adoption. You can request deletion of your data at any time by emailing us.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-dark mb-3">Your rights</h2>
        <p class="text-body leading-relaxed">You have the right to:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mt-2 text-body space-y-1">
          <li>Access the personal data we hold about you</li>
          <li>Request correction of any inaccurate data</li>
          <li>Request deletion of your data</li>
          <li>Withdraw your consent at any time</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-body leading-relaxed mt-2">To exercise any of these rights, contact us at <a href="mailto:donate2mypaws@gmail.com" class="text-teal hover:underline">donate2mypaws@gmail.com</a>.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-dark mb-3">Cookies</h2>
        <p class="text-body leading-relaxed">This website does not use cookies or tracking technologies.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-dark mb-3">Changes to this policy</h2>
        <p class="text-body leading-relaxed">We may update this privacy policy from time to time. The date at the top of this page shows when it was last updated.</p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
